# Mine integers out of messy text, then coalesce the ranges they describe.
#
# `Extract Integers` pulls every integer off each line (two per line here, so
# each row is a range), and `Merge Ranges` sorts and merges the overlapping or
# adjacent ones.
#
#   domain examples/11_merged_ranges.domain
#   Expected output: [[1, 8], [10, 12], [20, 20]]
Cursed Energy: 11_merged_ranges.input
Shikigami: Lines
Cursed Technique: Extract Integers
Maximum Technique: Merge Ranges
Reveal: stdout
